# Dedicated inspection and utility paths below the road deck.
BODY bridge_services
MATERIAL bridge_steel
FEATURE inspection_walkway
TYPE BOX
WIDTH 120000 mm
DEPTH 1200 mm
HEIGHT 200 mm
ORIGIN_X 0 mm
ORIGIN_Y 9400 mm
ORIGIN_Z 15000 mm
END
FEATURE utility_conduit
TYPE CYLINDER
RADIUS 250 mm
HEIGHT 120000 mm
ORIGIN_X 0 mm
ORIGIN_Y 11000 mm
ORIGIN_Z 15200 mm
ROTATION_Y 90 deg
END
END

# A programmable browser-viewer scene with camera and body animation tracks.
SCENE inspection_flythrough
DURATION 12 s
FPS 30
BACKGROUND SKY_DAY
LOOP 1
LIGHT sun DIRECTIONAL COLOR 1 0.95 0.86 INTENSITY 2.5
LIGHT inspection POINT COLOR 0.7 0.85 1 INTENSITY 4 AT inspection_light
EVENT 6 s service_apex
TRACK camera_orbit CAMERA main_camera
EASING EASE_IN_OUT
KEYFRAME 0 s POSITION 0 mm 0 mm 0 mm ROTATION 0 deg 0 deg 0 deg
KEYFRAME 12 s POSITION 0 mm 0 mm 0 mm ROTATION 0 deg 0 deg 18 deg
END
TRACK service_reveal BODY bridge_services
EASING EASE_IN_OUT
KEYFRAME 0 s POSITION 0 mm 0 mm 0 mm ROTATION 0 deg 0 deg 0 deg
KEYFRAME 6 s POSITION 0 mm 0 mm 1200 mm ROTATION 0 deg 0 deg 0 deg
KEYFRAME 12 s POSITION 0 mm 0 mm 0 mm ROTATION 0 deg 0 deg 0 deg
END
END
